## 🛠️ Technology Stack

Layer| Technologies
Frontend| React, JavaScript
UI components| Material UI (MUI)
Routing| React Router
HTTP requests| Axios
Backend| Python, Flask
ORM and persistence| Flask-SQLAlchemy, SQLite
AI integration| Google Gemini API
Video API integration| YouTube Data API, where used by the backend
Authentication| JWT, Flask-Bcrypt
Markdown rendering| React Markdown, remark-gfm
Date utilities| date-fns
Date selection| MUI Date Pickers
Carousel components| React Slick
Document processing| Python libraries used by the backend for supported formats
Frontend development tooling| Vite, npm

The final dependency list should be verified against the current "frontend/package.json" and backend "requirements.txt".

